meta {
  name: 6 Timetables
}

docs {
  Synchronous timetable generation over all stored teachers, batches and rooms.
  Generate and delete need `TIMETABLE_GENERATE` (HOD and above); reads need
  `TIMETABLE_READ`. Generation returns 400 until the database has at least one
  batch, one room, and a teacher for every batch subject.
}
